"Shows a macOS notification when Muxy is not frontmost." = "当 Muxy 不在最前面时显示 macOS 通知。";
"Shows app and subprocess CPU and memory usage in the status bar. Disabling it stops the sampling." = "在状态栏中显示 App 与子进程的 CPU 和内存占用。禁用后将停止采样。";
"Shows or hides the status bar." = "显示或隐藏状态栏。";
