"Shows the project search field whenever the project-focused sidebar is expanded." = "在项目优先边栏展开时始终显示项目搜索字段。";
"Shows the QR code used to pair a mobile device." = "显示用于配对移动设备的二维码。";
"Shows the permanent Home project at the top of the sidebar." = "在边栏顶部显示永久的“主页”项目。";
"Shows Muxy tips at the bottom of the built-in sidebar." = "在内置边栏底部显示 Muxy 提示。";
"Shows toast notifications." = "显示 Toast 通知。";
"Sidebar Vibrancy" = "边栏通透材质";
"Sorts the worktree switcher with the active worktree first, then by most-recently-used." = "在工作树切换器中先显示活动工作树，然后按最近使用排序。";
"Toast Notifications" = "Toast 通知";
"Toast Position" = "Toast 位置";
"Update Channel" = "更新通道";
"Uses the separately selected top-bar project target or an extension opener for terminal file links." = "对终端文件链接使用单独选择的顶栏项目目标或扩展打开方式。";
"Uses tinted native macOS vibrancy for the sidebar and its left title strip. Turn off for a solid background." = "对边栏及其左侧标题条使用带色调的原生 macOS 通透材质。关闭后使用纯色背景。";
